ATING CAPACITY TO NEARLY 75% BY THE END OF THE YEAR."}{'symbol': 'CBOE', 'date': '2021-07-20 03:00:00', 'title': 'CBOE EUROPE ENHANCES CBOE LIS BLOCK TRADING PLATFORM WITH DIRECTED IOI SERVICE', 'text': 'LONDON, JULY 20, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CBOE EUROPE, A PAN-EUROPEAN EXCHANGE OPERATOR AND SUBSIDIARY OF CBOE GLOBAL MARKETS, INC. (CBOE: CBOE), TODAY ANNOUNCED AN ENHANCEMENT TO ITS BLOCK TRADING PLATFORM, CBOE LIS, WHICH IS POWERED BY BIDS TECHNOLOGY, WITH THE ADDITION OF DIRECTED INDICATION OF INTEREST (DIOI) FUNCTIONALITY. THE SERVICE WAS SUCCESSFULLY LAUNCHED ON 12 JULY 2021 ON THE CBOE UK LIS PLATFORM.'}{'symbol': 'SCHW', 'date': '2021-07-20 15:18:00', 'title': 'CHARLES SCHWAB NAMED TO FORBES BEST EMPLOYERS FOR NEW GRADUATES LIST', 'text': 'WESTLAKE, TEXAS--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #BESTEMPLOYERS--CHARLES SCHWAB HAS BEEN NAMED AS ONE OF FORBES BEST EMPLOYERS FOR NEW GRADUATES FOR 2021, RANKING 15TH AMONG A FIELD OF 250 COMPANIES.'}{'symbol': 'CMG', 'date': '2021-07-20 16:10:00', 'title': 'CHIPOTLE ANNOUNCES SECOND QUARTER 2021 RESULTS', 'text': 'NEWPORT BEACH, CALIF., JULY 20, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CHIPOTLE MEXICAN GRILL, INC. (NYSE: CMG) TODAY REPORTED FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR ITS SECOND QUARTER ENDED JUNE 30, 2021.'}{'symbol': 'CTAS', 'date': '2021-07-20 09:10:00', 'title': 'TIPS FROM CINTAS HELP RESTAURANTS PREPARE FOR POST-PANDEMIC CHALLENGES', 'text': 'CINCINNATI--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AS THE WORLD CONTINUES TO RE-EMERGE FROM COVID-19 RESTRICTIONS, RESTAURANTS MUST PREPARE FOR THE INCREASE IN FOOT TRAFFIC AND CLEANLINESS EXPECTATIONS WHILE ALSO ADDRESSING HIRING CHALLENGES. TO HELP RESTAURANTS PREPARE FOR LIFTED RESTRICTIONS AND LABOR SHORTAGES, CINTAS CORPORATION (NASDAQ: CTAS) OFFERS FIVE ESSENTIAL TIPS. “FROM CLOSURES TO LIMITED CAPACITY TO OTHER RESTRICTIONS, THE RESTAURANT INDUSTRY REMARKABLY ADAPTED TO KEEP THEIR BUSINESSES RUNNING DURING TH'}{'symbol': 'CMCSA', 'date': '2021-07-20 10:00:00', 'title': 'COMCAST BUSINESS MOBILE LAUNCHES TO SMALL BUSINESSES NATIONWIDE